            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Definitions and data",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#01305C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "EBITDA = gross margin less operating expenses (labor, occupancy, marketing, technology and admin). Gross margin = net revenue less product cost, freight, shrink and obsolescence, and service delivery cost.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Commercial DSO = commercial receivables / last 3 months of commercial sales x 91. DIO = inventory / last 3 months of product cost x 91. DPO = payables / last 3 months of cost of sales x 91.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Liquidity = cash + undrawn revolver ($15M line). The lenders require at least $7.5M. Revenue bridge: volume at the budget average price, mix across product lines, price, and markdowns beyond the budgeted rate.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "All data is fictional: Foster Golf Co, 12 stores, e-commerce and 40 commercial accounts, Jan 2023 to Oct 2026 actuals, FY2024-26 budgets and a forecast to Dec 2027. Built with the Foster BI Toolkit: Sample Data Maker engine, Date Table Generator, Theme Builder, Layout Designer, KPI Visualizer, Chart Patterns, Field Parameter Builder, RLS Role Generator, Power Query Writer and Measure Describer; checked with the Model Linter and documented with the Model Documenter.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
